  "description": "<p>This task is to update the fcrepo-webapp-plus/xacml configuration such that:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>xacml/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/config/repository.json\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Uses the \"default\" workspace instead of \"fedora\"</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>xacml/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/spring\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>These configurations are in line with the \"audit\" example</li>\n\t\t<li>For example, when running xacml.war along side the fcrepo-camel-toolbox, camel is unable to connect to the JMS topics</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
